  "term": "TBI",
  "definition": "TBI stands for traumatic brain injury, an injury to the brain that is common in older adults and often happens after falls. Most cases in this age group are mild, but TBI is linked with higher risks of neurodegenerative, neuropsychiatric, and sleep problems, as well as disability and increased mortality.",
